'''''Limonium virgatum''''' is a species of plants in the family [[Plumbaginaceae]] (leadworts). Individuals can grow to 17&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Limonium virgatum (Willd.) Fourr. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/49105357|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Limonium virgatum (Violet Sea Lavender) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/PLMB/Limonium_virgatum.php |access-date=2022-03-05 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

